      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    closing_prices = [150, 152, 153, 150, 155, 157, 158, 160, 162, 161]\n    period = 5\n    smoothing_factor = 2 / (period + 1)\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    ema = sum(closing_prices[:period]) / period\n\n    for price in closing_prices[period:]:\n        ema = (price - ema) * smoothing_factor + ema\n\n    answer = round(ema, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
